      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Mam do ciebie prośbę* is I have a favour to ask you: a *prośba* is a request. *Czy możesz iść na zakupy?* asks a friend to go shopping. *Wolałbym nie* is I'd rather not (a woman says *wolałabym nie*), and *już idę* is I'm going. *Mamo!* is how you call your mum."
      }
